{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X对人物心理动机和前后因果的解释不如Y充分，尤其S06—S07、S11—S12，Y更容易让观众明白他为什么改变想法。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的加亮关键词能让我迅速抓住每段主旨，话句相对简洁，感受又有具体的声部、节奏、身体反应和情绪变化，听音乐时更容易把文字与正在发生的音乐联系起来。Y的优势是心理因果交代得更完整，人物前后的犹豫和转变更容易理解；但左侧长句与右侧密集短词同时出现，容易让我在阅读故事和扫视感受之间分散注意力。综合普通观众边听边看的体验，我更愿意选X，虽然它牺牲了一部分叙事解释的完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "77f82c66-4b3d-4ac7-b86a-b2ca1b91285b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T052126117922Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.829, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:22:00.961538+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2525b773c15d4f7ad4b1a4e4475fbe107bf8eb6e7fe2d03c6123536e19693db8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat